{
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "blockIndex": 0,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "四位有效数字数学用表中，也列有算术平方根表。\n它的排列方式与平方表相似。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "blockIndex": 1,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "平方根表给出从1到100各个数的平方根的近似值。\n从1到10，每隔0.001列出一个数；\n从10到100，每隔0.01列出一个数。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "blockIndex": 2,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "下面用几个例子说明怎样查表求平方根的近似值。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "blockIndex": 3,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "1. 求$\\sqrt{5.6}$的值。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "blockIndex": 4,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "在第一列找到5.6.\n从相邻一列的同一行读出$\\sqrt{5.6}$的近似值：\n$\\sqrt{5.6}\\approx2.366$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "blockIndex": 5,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "2. 求$\\sqrt{23.5}$的值。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "blockIndex": 6,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "在第一列找到23。\n从这一行与编号为5的列的交叉位置读出：\n$\\sqrt{23.5}\\approx4.848$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "3. 求$\\sqrt{45.34}$的值。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "blockIndex": 8,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "在第一列找到45。\n先从这一行与编号为3的列的交叉位置读出$\\sqrt{45.3}$的近似值：\n$\\sqrt{45.3}\\approx6.731$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "blockIndex": 9,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "再在修正值表的同一行、编号为4的列中找到3.\n按6.731最后一位的单位加上这个修正值，得到：\n$\\sqrt{45.34}\\approx6.734$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "blockIndex": 10,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "表中平方根近似值的绝对误差，不超过所保留的最后一位的半个单位。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "blockIndex": 11,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "例如，2.796是$\\sqrt{7.82}$的近似值，准确到0.001的一半，也就是0.0005.\n因此，2.796中的所有数字都是有效数字。"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "blockIndex": 12,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "同一张表也能用于求小于1或大于100的正数的平方根。\n下面继续看几个例子。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "blockIndex": 13,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "4. 求$\\sqrt{245}$的值。"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "blockIndex": 14,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "245是2.45的100倍，而2.45的平方根可以查表得到。\n因此：\n$\\sqrt{245}=\\sqrt{2.45\\times10^2}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "blockIndex": 15,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "根据积的平方根定理，得到：\n$\\sqrt{2.45\\times10^2}=\\sqrt{2.45}\\times10$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "blockIndex": 16,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "注：修正值的计算保证结果中的四个数字都是有效数字。"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "blockIndex": 17,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "查表求出$\\sqrt{2.45}$的近似值：\n$\\sqrt{2.45}\\approx1.565$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "blockIndex": 18,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "于是：\n$\\sqrt{245}=\\sqrt{2.45}\\times10\\approx1.565\\times10=15.65$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "blockIndex": 19,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "5. 求$\\sqrt{5634}$的值。"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "blockIndex": 20,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "把5634写成$56.34\\times10^2$，得到：\n$\\sqrt{56.34\\times10^2}=\\sqrt{56.34}\\times10$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "blockIndex": 21,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "先查表得到$\\sqrt{56.3}\\approx7.503$。\n再在修正值表编号为4的列中找到修正值3，按7.503最后一位的单位加上这个修正值，得到：\n$\\sqrt{56.34}\\approx7.506$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "blockIndex": 22,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "于是：\n$\\sqrt{5634}=10\\sqrt{56.34}\\approx75.06$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "blockIndex": 23,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "6. 求$\\sqrt{0.235}$的值。"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "blockIndex": 24,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "0.235是把23.5缩小100倍得到的。\n23.5的平方根可以查表得到，因此：\n$\\sqrt{0.235}=\\sqrt{23.5\\times10^{-2}}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "blockIndex": 25,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "因为：\n$\\sqrt{23.5\\times10^{-2}}=\\sqrt{23.5}\\times10^{-1}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "blockIndex": 26,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "所以：\n$\\sqrt{0.235}=\\sqrt{23.5}\\times10^{-1}\\approx4.848\\times10^{-1}=0.4848$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "blockIndex": 27,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "一般来说，要求小于1或大于100的正数的平方根，可以先把这个数写成$a\\times10^{2k}$，其中$1\\leq a<100$，$k$是整数。\n再利用积的平方根定理，就能查表求得结果。"
    }
  ],
  "resolvedBreaks": [
    7,
    10,
    12,
    27
  ],
